      "uid": "zhcn:fe8c6564a504e4533f3ec2b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我灵光一闪，往回翻真机伶的UG。\n接着，在闪耀系列赛的照片中，\n找到跟刚才那张照片一样的姿势。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d60b5794f100e3b69454ae11fe978f27b45f191fa4a18b306fd92fba641ccd0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
